# What must never enter a build context.
#
# Two jobs, and the first one matters more.
#
# 1. SECRECY. The build context is uploaded wholesale to the daemon, and
#    anything in it can be COPYed into a layer by a careless later edit. `.env`
#    holds a live CockroachDB password and a live Google AI Studio key. A layer
#    is not deleted by a later `rm` — it stays in the image history and is
#    pushed to Artifact Registry with everything else. The `.env` rules below
#    are the load-bearing lines in this file.
#
# 2. SIZE AND CACHE. db/seeds/vectors.parquet alone is 69.9 MB, and node_modules
#    plus the caches run to hundreds. Everything excluded here is something the
#    build would upload on every single invocation and never read.
#
# Written as an allowlist would be safer still, but Docker's ignore syntax makes
# re-inclusion (`!pattern`) order-dependent and easy to get subtly wrong; a
# denylist that is reviewed is better than an allowlist that is misread.

# --- secrets: never, under any pattern ---------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.aws/
.gcloud/
gha-creds-*.json
service-account*.json

# --- version control and CI ---------------------------------------------------
.git/
.github/
.gitleaks.toml
.gitleaksignore

# --- the discarded AWS estate -------------------------------------------------
# PIVOT.md: infra/cdk is 10 stacks and 7,861 lines of AWS CDK, retained only as
# a record of a rejected alternative. It has no business in a Cloud Run image.
infra/

# --- large data the serving path never reads ----------------------------------
# The seed corpus and its vector cache are seed-time artifacts, loaded by
# scripts/seed running as pv_migrator from an operator machine.
db/seeds/vectors.parquet
.pv-objects/
demo/artifacts/

# --- caches and build output --------------------------------------------------
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.import_linter_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
infra/cdk/cdk.out/

# --- scratch ------------------------------------------------------------------
tmp/
.scratch/
.playwright-mcp/
*-report.json

# --- tests and tooling --------------------------------------------------------
# The serving image runs neither. Excluded from the context rather than merely
# not COPYed, so a future `COPY . .` cannot pull them in.
**/tests/
tests/
tools/
evals/
ops/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
Design.pdf
